# Cross-origin isolation lets on-device transcription use several CPU cores (multi-threaded
# WASM). require-corp (not credentialless) so iPad Safari gets it too. Model downloads from
# Hugging Face and the jsDelivr fallback send CORS/CORP headers, so they still load.
/*
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
